&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More and more PlanetScale databases are created, connected and queried by AI agents. Cursor, Claude Code, Codex and a growing list of other tools now sit between developers and their infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own that experience end to end. You&#39;ll make sure PlanetScale shows up everywhere developers build with AI, that our MCP server and CLI work flawlessly in every agent, and that we can measure how well it all works. Then you&#39;ll show the world how to do it well through demos, docs, blog posts, videos, and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role combining engineering, content creation, and a strong public voice. You&#39;ll work closely with the teams that build our MCP server, CLI, API and docs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The landscape of how developers work with AI changes fast. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to move quickly, experiment, and take the lead on the future of AI use with databases and infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Make PlanetScale great with AI tools&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain the plugins for PlanetScale in every AI marketplace and directory: agent plugins, skill registries, MCP directories, IDE extension stores and AI app builders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own our integrations with AI coding tools, agent frameworks and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with AI tools as they launch and ensure our customers have a great experience from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test the PlanetScale MCP server and CLI across Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, VS Code and other clients, and catch regressions before users do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find friction in creating a database, connecting, running migrations and debugging queries from inside an agent, then fix it or drive the fix with the owning team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the context agents rely on: tool descriptions, skills, llms.txt, docs written for agents, and error messages agents can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to AEO (answer engine optimization): make sure agents find and recommend PlanetScale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain skills for working with Postgres, MySQL, Vitess, Neki, and PlanetScale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Measure how well we&#39;re doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build evals that run real agent tasks against PlanetScale databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benchmark how agents perform with PlanetScale and work towards continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track how often AI assistants and agents recommend PlanetScale for database questions, and whether what they say about us is accurate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instrument and report on agent usage: databases created by agents, time to first connection, MCP versus CLI usage, and where sessions fail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Show people how to do it well&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build demos and sample apps that show PlanetScale and AI tooling at their best&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write docs, guides and blog posts on using databases effectively with AI, including safe access, branching and performance assessment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make videos and attend conferences to communicate with our audience how to build effectively with AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;These attributes best describe you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily use of AI coding agents, with strong opinions about what makes a tool work well with them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building an MCP server, plugin, CLI or SDK that real developers use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software engineering background in languages like TypeScript and Go, and comfort with APIs, OAuth and the command line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with writing docs, blogs, and / or video content creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good at communicating with a broad audience and customers alike on socials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with relational databases (Postgres, MySQL, SQLite), schema design, migrations, connection handling, and Postgres or MySQL in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data fluency: designing evals, writing the queries behind a dashboard, and telling a real trend from noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication of technical ideas in writing, on video and on stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independence and speed: spotting a gap, shipping a fix, and telling people about it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about the AI tooling landscape and a habit of keeping up with it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Bonus points&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to the MCP spec, SDKs or popular open-source MCP servers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing agent skills, plugins or rules files for Claude Code, Cursor or Codex&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with LLM eval tools and building benchmarks for agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AEO or GEO, or with tracking how LLMs surface and recommend a product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A blog, YouTube channel or GitHub that developers already follow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Vitess, database sharding, or running databases at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why PlanetScale&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re redefining how high-growth companies manage data at scale—and we work with some of the most exciting brands in gaming, consumer tech, and B2B SaaS. As a Software Engineer, you&#39;ll be at the core of building the platform that powers world-class apps used by hundreds of millions of users worldwide. PlanetScale is a profitable company with a philosophy centered around building small teams of p99 individuals and is recognized as one of the fastest growing companies in America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At PlanetScale we believe in supporting people to do their best work and thrive no matter the location. Our mission is to build a diverse, equitable, and inclusive company. We strive to build an inclusive environment where all people feel that they are equally respected and valued, whether they are a candidate or an employee. We welcome applicants of any educational background, gender identity and expression, sexual orientation, religion, ethnicity, age, citizenship, socioeconomic status, disability, pregnancy status, and veteran status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability, please let us know if there&#39;s any way we can make the interview process better for you; we&#39;re happy to accommodate!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Total Compensation and Pay Transparency&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An employee&#39;s total compensation consists of base salary + variable comp where appropriate + benefits + equity. A member of our Talent Acquisition team will be happy to answer any further questions when we engage with you to begin the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base Salary Range: $170,000 - $220,000&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;PlanetScale is growing rapidly and reinventing the database space. Our database platform offers developers the fastest and most reliable Postgres and Vitess/MySQL databases, enabling businesses to efficiently handle data and workloads of all sizes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PlanetScale is backed with over $100M in venture financing from top-tier VCs including a16z, Kleiner Perkins, SignalFire, and Insight Venture Partners. And we serve some of the most innovative companies in the world such as Block, Anysphere (Cursor), MyFitnessPal, Etsy, Kick, and thousands more. Our customers entrust us with what is often their most precious digital asset, their data, so the stakes couldn&#39;t be higher.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Brand Designer to help shape and evolve the visual identity of PlanetScale across all touchpoints. In this role, you&#39;ll be a key member of our Marketing team, translating complex technical concepts into compelling visual stories that resonate with developers and technical decision-makers. You&#39;ll craft everything from in-person event experiences to web graphics, merch designs, and creative website assets that make databases feel exciting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s the job to be done?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visual Brand Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design web graphics including technical diagrams, illustrations, and interactive visual assets that simplify complex database concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create compelling visual systems for campaigns, product launches, and marketing initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for multiple formats and contexts: digital, print, experiential, and merchandise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person Experiences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design booth graphics, signage, and environmental branding for conferences, meetups, and community events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the events team to create memorable, on-brand experiences that stand out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design merch that developers actually want to wear and use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create branded collateral including banners, posters, stickers, and promotional materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Website and Digital Assets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design creative website components and landing pages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design data visualizations and technical diagrams that make complex information accessible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create social media graphics, blog post imagery, and other digital marketing assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop templates and design systems that enable the team to move quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand Evolution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with marketing leadership to evolve and expand the PlanetScale brand identity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore new visual directions while maintaining brand coherence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document design decisions and maintain brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;These attributes best describe you.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating versatile design skills across digital, print, and experiential design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of design fundamentals: typography, color, composition, and visual hierarchy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve figured out where AI actually helps in a design workflow and built process around it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in both brand and production modes. You can think big picture and execute in the details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to both articulate design decisions and understand direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed and able to manage multiple projects with competing deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative spirit with the ability to incorporate feedback while maintaining creative vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What else will help you be successful.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for technical or developer-focused brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Figma, Adobe Creative Suite, and other design tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI to build a working first draft of a page rather than handing off a static mockup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of design systems and component-based thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for learning about databases, infrastructure, and developer tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why PlanetScale&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re redefining how high-growth companies manage data at scale—and we work with some of the most exciting brands in gaming, consumer tech, and B2B SaaS. As a Brand Designer, you&#39;ll help shape how developers and engineering leaders perceive and interact with PlanetScale, translating the power of our platform into visual experiences that inspire and inform. PlanetScale is a profitable company with a philosophy centered around building small teams of p99 individuals and is recognized as one of the fastest growing companies in America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At PlanetScale we believe in supporting people to do their best work and thrive no matter the location. Our mission is to build a diverse, equitable, and inclusive company. We strive to build an inclusive environment where all people feel that they are equally respected and valued, whether they are a candidate or an employee. We welcome applicants of any educational background, gender identity and expression, sexual orientation, religion, ethnicity, age, citizenship, socioeconomic status, disability, pregnancy status, and veteran status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability, please let us know if there&#39;s any way we can make the interview process better for you; we&#39;re happy to accommodate!&lt;/p&gt;
